# Bitcoin Quay fork

This repository tracks `BTCDecoded/blvm`. Quay's own code stays in `quay/` and `website/`.

- Do not push this fork to BTCDecoded remotes.
- Upstream tag merges restore `[patch.crates-io]` in `Cargo.toml`. Drop that block so the fork keeps building from crates.io. See `QUAY.md`.
- Profiles describe control design. Do not claim SOC, PCI, or NACHA certification.
- Do not add key custody, freeform wallet send, PAN storage, or ACH file generation.
